{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[Am]Sad I [E]sit on [Am]Butternut [E]Hill,
[C]Who could blame me, [C]cry my Fill? And
[Am]Every tear would [Am]turn a mill.
[Am]Johnny has [E]gone for [Am]Soldier
